      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "- Test inbound/outbound TCP/UDP traffic with various protocols and ports.\n- Verify SPI functionality with multiple stateful connections.\n- Check rule-based filtering engine with diverse IP/Port/Protocol combinations.\n- Confirm syslog logging for all denied attempts.\n- Ensure admin dashboard allows rule updates.\n- Simulate DDoS attacks to test firewall resilience.\n- Test firewall behavior under high traffic load.\n- Validate firewall's ability to handle encrypted traffic.\n- Check firewall's performance with different hardware configurations.\n- Test firewall's compatibility with various operating systems.\n- Verify firewall's ability to handle simultaneous connections.\n- Test firewall's response to malformed packets.\n- Check firewall's ability to handle large data packets.\n- Test firewall's response to ICMP echo requests.\n- Verify firewall's ability to handle broadcast packets.\n- Test firewall's ability to handle multicast packets.\n- Check firewall's ability to handle packets with invalid IP addresses.\n- Test firewall's ability to handle packets with invalid port numbers.\n- Test firewall's ability to handle packets with invalid protocols.\n- Test firewall's ability to handle packets with invalid packet lengths.\n- Test firewall's ability to handle packets with invalid packet types.\n- Test firewall's ability to handle packets with invalid packet flags.\n- Test firewall",
